Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Each review keeps an optional `sig` of what it was asked on (the week's meals with day, kcal and macros,
  every workout the coach sees, Claude's workout analyses). If that changes before the next week's
  Wednesday ends, the week is asked for once more; the redo keeps no sig, so it is never redone again.
  Reviews written before have no sig and are left as they are. A failed workouts read is not a change;
  only a failed request waits the retry hours.
- The Today food card collects FoodStore's flow, so a meal saved, edited or deleted on the Food tab shows
  at once, like the other Food cards.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
